WEBVTT

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.393
Outside the US,

00:01:01.417 --> 00:01:05.184
especially in the Middle East
and throughout Southeastern Africa,

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:09.809
COVID-19 was paralyzing food systems
that were already vulnerable.

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:13.684
Oxfam has predicted
that by the end of 2020

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:18.684
12,000 people per day could die
of hunger related to COVID.

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:21.309
That's more than the highest
daily mortality rate

00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:23.059
recorded so far.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.351
But what's worse

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:26.934
and what's much more
concerning to all of us

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:30.226
is that COVID is just one
of many major disruptions